WEBVTT

00:00:00.587 --> 00:00:02.567
Symphony gives you five places to plan.

00:00:03.339 --> 00:00:04.739
The year is for your bigger goals.

00:00:05.639 --> 00:00:07.479
The season and month help you decide what

00:00:07.479 --> 00:00:08.359
to focus on next.

00:00:09.579 --> 00:00:11.179
The week is where you choose your commitments,

00:00:11.859 --> 00:00:13.339
and today is where you get to work.

00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:15.619
You can start wherever you need to.

00:00:16.259 --> 00:00:18.699
Let’s follow one family goal through all five.
